OL,3,GNEWSACharity minibus stolen and
OL,4,Astripped for parts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity says services for some of its
OL,7,Fmost vulnerable users have been
OL,8,Fdisrupted after one of its
OL,9,Fwheelchair-accessible minibuses was
OL,10,Fstolen and stripped for parts, while
OL,11,Fanother was damaged.
OL,13,FVoluntary Action Rutland (VAR), which
OL,14,Fprovides community transport and
OL,15,Fsupport services across Rutland and
OL,16,FStamford, said a 16-seater minibus was
OL,17,Ftaken from its base at Oakham
OL,18,FEnterprise Park and later found in a
OL,19,Fnearby field.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
