OL,3,GNEWSACharity minibus stolen and
OL,4,Astripped for parts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vehicle's engine had been removed,
OL,7,Fwhile a second accessible vehicle was
OL,8,Falso damaged.
OL,10,FChief executive Tom Walters described
OL,11,Fthe theft, which happened on Friday, as
OL,12,F"heartbreaking".
